  {
   "t0": 6.76,
   "text": "Yes, you should check the label.",
   "t1": 7.87
  },
  {
   "t0": 7.87,
   "text": "You should see either cyanocobalamin or methylcobalamin on the label,",
   "t1": 12.05
  },
  {
   "t0": 12.05,
   "text": "but basically nothing much else in there.",
   "t1": 14.28
  },
  {
   "t0": 14.28,
   "text": "The cyanocobalamin will work just fine for everybody.",
   "t1": 17.7
